1
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:13,740
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,500
Your moves!

3
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,100
This is impossible!

4
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:15,880
Their power is equal!

5
00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:26,017
He withstood the assault
of an Egyptian god!

6
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:30,460
But had I not acquired the attacking
power of Kaiba's Blue Eyes,

7
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,657
my Deerbound would have been destroyed.

8
00:01:32,740 --> 00:01:35,760
I'd best be taking my leave for now.

9
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:38,320
This isn't over, Pharaoh.

10
00:01:38,860 --> 00:01:39,720
And you?

11
00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:41,620
I believe it's Mahad.

12
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:44,841
Don't grow too fond of
that item around your neck.

13
00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:48,857
I have a special, shall we say,
attachment to the Millennium Ring.

14
00:01:48,940 --> 00:01:50,560
At one time, it was mine.

15
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:53,100
This item was created for me.

16
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:54,577
So you lie.

17
00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:59,417
but it is destined for me in
fact all seven millennium items

18
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:04,980
have been fated to fall into
my hands just you wait stop

19
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:13,680
we mustn't let him escape
God after him yes master

20
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,340
You can't contain me!

21
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:31,320
Till we meet again!

22
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:39,760
So I was sent back in time to
relive these events all over again?

23
00:02:40,940 --> 00:02:44,537
Shimon tell me what is
that strange object in

24
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:50,540
the sky what do you mean
up there that pyramid

25
00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:58,940
I'm sorry your excellency I don't see
anything but it's right there in plain sight

26
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:05,817
Pharaoh let's go in it's
been a long day very well I'm

27
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:08,837
sure it has something to do
with Bakura's Shadow game,

28
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,840
but why can no one else see it?

29
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:17,960
Is he truly the chosen pharaoh
the scriptures speak of?

30
00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:22,220
My king, you fought bravely.

31
00:03:22,420 --> 00:03:24,773
Yes, thanks to you we can all rest well.

32
00:03:26,540 --> 00:03:31,040
If only Kaiba were able to see
himself fighting boldly by my side.

33
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:37,540
Can't these people see
this is only a card game?

34
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:40,060
What are you looking at?

35
00:03:40,660 --> 00:03:43,420
You think I'm going to
let you change my mind?

36
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,100
I am not flying to Egypt.

37
00:03:46,460 --> 00:03:47,440
Look at me.

38
00:03:47,740 --> 00:03:50,360
I'm talking to some
golden antique eyeball.

39
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,920
Hold on. What's that?

40
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,840
No way.

41
00:04:06,140 --> 00:04:07,040
It's a trick.

42
00:04:15,060 --> 00:04:19,297
I've been hearing about this ancient
nonsense for too long And the only

43
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:24,520
way to shut these people up is to
prove them all wrong This is KC-1,

44
00:04:24,740 --> 00:04:26,580
setting course for Cairo, Egypt

45
00:04:30,820 --> 00:04:32,620
Any word on Bakura?

46
00:04:32,980 --> 00:04:37,420
With an entire squadron of guards on
his trail, he will not get far Really?

47
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:42,137
After seeing his frighteningly
impressive display of power, I disagree.

48
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:43,340
Listen, Seto.

49
00:04:43,540 --> 00:04:46,040
We're not dealing with any ordinary thief.

50
00:04:46,380 --> 00:04:51,086
He's harboring a creature with a strength
that rivals that of the Egyptian gods.

51
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,310
Hmm.

52
00:04:52,393 --> 00:04:54,984
Master Ak-Nadin, you have
just given me an idea.

53
00:04:55,220 --> 00:04:57,957
This tablet sanctuary is full of creatures

54
00:04:58,040 --> 00:05:00,237
we've pulled from the hearts of criminals.

55
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:05,040
Surely there must be other evildoers
harboring as much darkness as this Bakura,

56
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,280
wouldn't you say?

57
00:05:06,540 --> 00:05:07,370
I would.

58
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,740
Your king wanted power.

59
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:15,746
That's why he devised a plan to use the
seven items to control the entire world.

60
00:05:15,860 --> 00:05:18,420
The secret lies in the
village of Kal Elna.

61
00:05:19,460 --> 00:05:23,284
Perhaps Bakura escaped from that
village before it was destroyed.

62
00:05:23,380 --> 00:05:27,717
That would explain the incredible power
of the beast that dwells within him.

63
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:30,565
For his anger and hatred
would be immeasurable.

64
00:05:31,020 --> 00:05:33,477
All we need to do is find these criminals.

65
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:36,517
Then we simply use the
Millennium Items to harness

66
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:39,541
the evil creatures that
dwell within their hearts.

67
00:05:40,300 --> 00:05:43,660
Yes, we'll have an unstoppable
army of Shadow Monsters.

68
00:05:43,980 --> 00:05:49,520
Seto, what you're suggesting is completely
immoral, not to mention quite dangerous.

69
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,640
With all due respect, Master,

70
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:54,537
would we not be reducing
the amount of Lawbreakers

71
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:56,817
that wreak havoc on
this kingdom every day?

72
00:05:56,900 --> 00:05:58,437
Perhaps. And in the end,

73
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:03,167
we would be creating this monster army
in order to protect the people of Egypt.

74
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:06,277
Is that not what we all
promised to do the day we

75
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:09,478
took our oath as the sacred
guardians of the pharaoh?

76
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:23,780
Millennium Necklace, show
me what dangers lie ahead.

77
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:31,110
Nothing?

78
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:36,540
Ever since Bakura arrived, my vision
of the future has been clouded.

79
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:41,277
It's as if the kingdom is
shrouded in a blanket of shadows.

80
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:44,757
But I must continue my efforts
to see through the darkness.

81
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:46,722
You should preserve your energy.

82
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:51,055
This evening's battle with Bakura has
taken its toll on all of us, Isis.

83
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:55,437
When he returns, we will need our
full power in order to face him.

84
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:57,814
So listen to Shaddaa and get some rest.

85
00:06:57,900 --> 00:06:59,477
I appreciate your help.

86
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,780
Both of you,

87
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,397
but my Millennium Necklace may be our only

88
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:06,127
hope of knowing what
Bakura is plotting next.

89
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:09,912
Since the well-being of the
citizens of Egypt is at stake,

90
00:07:10,100 --> 00:07:12,629
I'm afraid rest is a
luxury I can't afford.

91
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:19,360
If I'm unable to save mankind from
the evil that's about to unfold,

92
00:07:19,780 --> 00:07:21,740
what will become of the future?

93
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:27,600
The safety of my friends
depends upon my victory.

94
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:32,200
Yugi, I'll do whatever
I can to protect you.

95
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:41,569
Every doorway in this
place looks the same.

96
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:43,000
No joke.

97
00:07:43,380 --> 00:07:45,204
We'll never find the right one.

98
00:07:45,780 --> 00:07:48,840
And every time I open one,
I find 50 more of them.

99
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:50,880
Even the doors have doors?

100
00:07:51,740 --> 00:07:52,570
Hey guys,

101
00:07:52,653 --> 00:07:55,897
either the batteries on my watch just
died or time is somehow standing still.

102
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:56,920
Hmm?

103
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:58,580
Hey, she's right.

104
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:01,877
Dudes, this place is
starting to freak me out.

105
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:04,577
If we don't find the Pharaoh
soon, I'm gonna lose it.

106
00:08:04,660 --> 00:08:05,490
Hold on.

107
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:06,682
That's the one!

108
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:10,212
I don't have a Millennium
thingy, but I do have instincts.

109
00:08:10,820 --> 00:08:14,180
Then I say we bust that
sucker down on three! Three!

110
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:16,540
Nice! Wait!

111
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:19,600
Pharaoh, here we come!

112
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,137
So much for your instincts!

113
00:08:25,220 --> 00:08:26,050
That's weird.

114
00:08:26,133 --> 00:08:28,394
How can they be up there and down here?

115
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,129
Let's ask questions later.

116
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:33,590
Thanks.

117
00:08:33,673 --> 00:08:37,437
Many doorways within the chasms of
the Millennium Puzzle contain traps.

118
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:40,344
You might want to tell
us that sooner next time!

119
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:42,800
Many doorways contain traps.

120
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:46,636
I thought he was supposed
to find this doorway for us.

121
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,360
Hey, wait a sec.

122
00:08:48,780 --> 00:08:52,017
There's no one who's closer to the
Pharaoh than Yugi is, right, guys?

123
00:08:52,100 --> 00:08:56,697
So maybe if you concentrate hard enough,
you can figure out what door he's behind.

124
00:08:56,780 --> 00:08:57,610
I'll try.

125
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,605
Hey, it's worth a shot, right?

126
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:01,400
Well, I suppose.

127
00:09:01,860 --> 00:09:05,497
But ever since his spirit left the
puzzle, I haven't sensed him at all.

128
00:09:05,580 --> 00:09:06,920
Just try, Yug.

129
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:09,178
It may be the only chance we've got.

130
00:09:09,340 --> 00:09:10,811
Pharaoh, can you hear me?

131
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:14,999
We're all inside the Millennium
Puzzle, and we're trying to find you.

132
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:16,630
Pharaoh?

133
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:18,060
Are you out there?

134
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:19,630
Hello?

135
00:09:20,620 --> 00:09:21,450
Pharaoh!

136
00:09:24,740 --> 00:09:30,337
it's strange everyone here seems
to know me quite well but i have

137
00:09:30,420 --> 00:09:34,477
no memory of any of them what did
all these people mean to me when

138
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:39,017
i was pharaoh did i consider them
my friends or were they merely my

139
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:43,937
servants pardon me my pharaoh how

140
00:09:44,020 --> 00:09:46,680
can i help you uh what's his name

141
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:48,450
Mahad!

142
00:09:48,533 --> 00:09:52,060
My king, please accept my
apologies for the interruption.

143
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:55,085
But it is not wise for
you to be outside alone.

144
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:56,915
Perhaps you're right.

145
00:09:57,140 --> 00:09:58,400
It's not safe here.

146
00:09:58,700 --> 00:09:59,680
We should go.

147
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,017
Yes, stay close.

148
00:10:02,100 --> 00:10:03,500
Especially after today.

149
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:08,400
One can never be too cautious.

150
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,100
Did you hear that?

151
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:12,360
Stay behind me.

152
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:18,840
Oh, Mana, what are you doing?

153
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,310
What?

154
00:10:20,393 --> 00:10:22,493
I can't pay a visit to my oldest friend?

155
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:24,760
I just miss him, that's all.

156
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:29,017
Ever since he's become the new pharaoh,
we haven't been able to talk at all.

157
00:10:29,100 --> 00:10:31,020
It has only been one day.

158
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:35,580
You're Mana, and you
and I grew up together.

159
00:10:36,100 --> 00:10:40,177
I know we haven't spoken in a whole
day, but you didn't forget me, did you?

160
00:10:40,260 --> 00:10:43,280
After all these years of
practicing magic together,

161
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:46,180
I mean, you and I are practically family.

162
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:50,040
Yes, of course. Hold on!

163
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:54,017
You haven't been walking around in the
desert without wearing a hat again,

164
00:10:54,100 --> 00:10:54,930
now have you?

165
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,500
Mana, that is enough.

166
00:10:56,820 --> 00:10:58,540
It is not like it used to be.

167
00:10:58,760 --> 00:10:59,780
Do you not see?

168
00:10:59,980 --> 00:11:02,797
He is the king of Egypt now
and does not have time for...

169
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:05,645
And he does not have time
to speak for himself?

170
00:11:06,300 --> 00:11:09,476
Is that why you've been doing
all the talking for him?

171
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,340
That is not true.

172
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:13,953
How did you get past the guards, anyway?

173
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,560
Well, my magic's been improving.

174
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:19,577
Do not tell me you used
your freezing spell.

175
00:11:19,660 --> 00:11:21,640
We need them to guard the palace.

176
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:23,680
Oops, sorry.

177
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,000
I released these.

178
00:11:26,100 --> 00:11:27,000
Uh-oh.

179
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:29,200
Your magic's improving, is it?

180
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:30,980
Let me try that again.

181
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:37,060
It's in here somewhere. Just hurry up.

182
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:38,790
Let's see.

183
00:11:39,060 --> 00:11:42,097
Turning humans into toads,
getting rid of bad breath.

184
00:11:42,180 --> 00:11:43,960
Ah, the freeze spell.

185
00:11:44,180 --> 00:11:46,080
It's good to know I had friends.

186
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:55,940
Perhaps trying to acquire all seven
Millennium items at once was a bit ambitious.

187
00:11:56,580 --> 00:11:57,880
But no matter.

188
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,948
They'll come to me in time.

189
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:03,700
So for now, I'll focus
on one in particular.

190
00:12:04,180 --> 00:12:05,400
The Millennium Ring.

191
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:09,220
Once I obtain that, the
others will soon follow.

192
00:12:09,780 --> 00:12:11,500
Sleep well, Tharrow.

193
00:12:15,420 --> 00:12:18,040
The damage looks quite extensive, sir.

194
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:21,680
You will not get away with this, Bakura.

195
00:12:22,140 --> 00:12:23,060
Excuse me.

196
00:12:23,580 --> 00:12:24,410
Yes?

197
00:12:24,940 --> 00:12:27,705
Are you here to protect
us from that scary guy?

198
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:30,180
Yes, we are.

199
00:12:30,500 --> 00:12:33,120
I promise he will not scare anyone again.

200
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,020
Ah, good.

201
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,660
The Millennium Ring.

202
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,840
How strange.

203
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:42,950
Akura!

204
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,100
Know this.

205
00:12:49,500 --> 00:12:54,088
I shall do everything in my power to
keep your darkness far from this kingdom.

206
00:12:58,860 --> 00:12:59,860
So tell me,

207
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:03,457
is everything really going to
change now that you become this big,

208
00:13:03,540 --> 00:13:04,599
important pharaoh?

209
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:09,220
To be honest, it's hard to remember
what life was like before I was king.

210
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:12,657
You must have a lot on
your mind these days.

211
00:13:12,740 --> 00:13:13,600
Yes, I do.

212
00:13:13,860 --> 00:13:16,780
But you still have time
for me, right? Of course.

213
00:13:19,020 --> 00:13:20,597
Mana, would you...

214
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:21,537
could you...

215
00:13:21,620 --> 00:13:23,620
tell me more about us?

216
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:25,701
Wait, you're serious, aren't you?

217
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:27,918
This pharaoh thing's made you weird.

218
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:30,180
Oops, did I say that out loud?

219
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:31,360
It's fine.

220
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:34,317
I guess now that you're the king of Egypt,

221
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:37,576
I need to start calling you
things like your highness.

222
00:13:38,100 --> 00:13:38,930
Weird.

223
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:47,460
Oh! Mahad!

224
00:13:47,700 --> 00:13:48,860
You startled me!

225
00:13:49,540 --> 00:13:50,481
Greetings, Isis.

226
00:13:53,300 --> 00:13:56,712
Have you discovered what the
future holds for our kingdom?

227
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:58,280
No, I have not.

228
00:13:58,660 --> 00:14:01,542
My Millennium Necklace
has been acting strangely.

229
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:02,630
I see.

230
00:14:02,900 --> 00:14:04,480
So has my ring.

231
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:06,177
It's Bakura.

232
00:14:06,260 --> 00:14:07,820
You need not worry.

233
00:14:08,220 --> 00:14:11,477
I have faith that our new pharaoh
will lead us from this darkness.

234
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:12,390
Yes.

235
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:22,360
Please, Millennium
Necklace, I beseech thee,

236
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:26,055
pierce the shadows and show
me the light of the future.

237
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,580
Wait, what is this?

238
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:31,880
I see something.

239
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:41,220
Oh, jumbled pieces of events yet to come.

240
00:14:41,540 --> 00:14:43,457
I sense a great evil.

241
00:14:43,540 --> 00:14:45,360
I must tell Mahad.

242
00:14:47,880 --> 00:14:50,220
My pharaoh, rest assured,

243
00:14:50,460 --> 00:14:54,754
the sacred tomb of former king Aknam
Cannon will never be disturbed again.

244
00:14:54,980 --> 00:14:59,800
My team of sorcerers is casting a
spell to secure its walls as we speak.

245
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:01,670
Excellent.

246
00:15:02,300 --> 00:15:03,130
Yes,

247
00:15:03,213 --> 00:15:04,597
but I will believe that tomb is safe from

248
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:07,209
intruders once I have
tested it for myself.

249
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:12,260
After all, we've seen what your
magicians in training are capable of.

250
00:15:12,460 --> 00:15:15,166
I would say a bit more
training couldn't hurt.

251
00:15:15,860 --> 00:15:18,036
All right, Seto, that's quite enough.

252
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:19,270
I agree.

253
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:22,520
Good luck to you, Mahad,
and thank you. My king.

254
00:15:27,520 --> 00:15:28,350
Mahad, wait!

255
00:15:28,433 --> 00:15:30,297
Please take me with you, Master!

256
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:33,457
I've been practicing my
spells and I can help!

257
00:15:33,540 --> 00:15:34,775
Come back here, mana!

258
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:40,740
I'm afraid it's too dangerous
and you're merely a student.

259
00:15:41,140 --> 00:15:42,640
I'm Mahad's top student.

260
00:15:42,940 --> 00:15:46,822
I have twice the skills of any
magician he's leading to that tomb.

261
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:48,780
My master needs me!

262
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:53,320
It seems to me you underestimate
the skills of your teacher. Huh?

263
00:15:53,940 --> 00:15:55,557
Mahad is a strong wizard.

264
00:15:55,640 --> 00:15:56,720
In fact,

265
00:15:56,860 --> 00:16:01,117
you would not find a more powerful
magician if you searched the entire world.

266
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,260
He'll be fine.

267
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:03,860
Yes, I know.

268
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:07,737
What she doesn't know is that
Mahad's true power was so great,

269
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:11,037
he had to lock a portion of
it away for his own safety.

270
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:13,414
If he were to release his full ability,

271
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:18,033
Mahad's strength could exceed that of
any guardian in the Pharaoh's court.

272
00:16:23,780 --> 00:16:24,610
Isis.

273
00:16:25,860 --> 00:16:27,220
Mahad! What's wrong?

274
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:31,727
I'm not sure you should
go through with this.

275
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:36,344
So you were able to read
my future, weren't you?

276
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:38,770
Please.

277
00:16:38,853 --> 00:16:40,876
Actually, I would prefer not to know.

278
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:44,720
Isis, keep an eye on the Pharaoh.

279
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:48,700
Please wait.

280
00:16:49,280 --> 00:16:52,480
Just know that in my
vision, you do return.

281
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:54,390
Thank you.

282
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:05,260
It has always been my duty
To protect you, my Pharaoh

283
00:17:09,800 --> 00:17:12,320
Here, Mana Thank you, Prince

284
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,060
There you are

285
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:18,660
Let me guess My father
asked you to look after me

286
00:17:21,500 --> 00:17:23,180
Watch out! Behind you!

287
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:26,960
No, Mahat!

288
00:17:28,540 --> 00:17:30,300
My prince, are you all right?

289
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:31,400
I am fine.

290
00:17:31,980 --> 00:17:33,100
What about you?

291
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:35,420
Forget about me. Don't move.

292
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:37,680
No, my prince.

293
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:39,979
The future pharaoh needn't do this.

294
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:44,853
You were bit by a snake, and
I am getting the poison out.

295
00:17:44,940 --> 00:17:48,057
If it were the other way around,
you would do the same thing for me.

296
00:17:48,140 --> 00:17:49,316
And do you know why?

297
00:17:49,540 --> 00:17:50,893
Because we are friends.

298
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:52,317
Yes, we are.

299
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:54,960
And someday when I become pharaoh,

300
00:17:55,140 --> 00:17:58,097
I know you will be standing
right there by my side, Mahad.

301
00:17:58,180 --> 00:18:00,180
I would not have it any other way.

302
00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:07,060
Even as a child, you protected me
more than I could ever protect you.

303
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:08,700
So know this.

304
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:13,260
Wherever destiny may lead me,
I promise to return that favor.

305
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:17,960
The Valley of the Kings isn't this way.

306
00:18:18,420 --> 00:18:19,520
Quiet back there.

307
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:22,120
Our orders are to follow Master Mahad.

308
00:18:36,340 --> 00:18:40,100
I swore I would never do this,
but I do not see any other way.

309
00:18:40,380 --> 00:18:45,240
In order to defeat Bakura, I must release
the power I sealed away so long ago.

310
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:51,320
Sacred Millennium Ring, I call upon thee.

311
00:18:54,120 --> 00:18:56,600
Unlock the great force I buried here.

312
00:19:02,060 --> 00:19:04,420
He's backed himself into a corner.

313
00:19:06,040 --> 00:19:07,180
Follow me!

314
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:08,950
Now!

315
00:19:12,900 --> 00:19:14,980
Best of luck, Master Mahan.

316
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:18,620
I guess it's just you and me now.

317
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:23,060
Now, come out, come out, wherever you are.

318
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:29,840
Well, what do we have here?

319
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:36,340
Let the festivities commence.

320
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:38,800
I have been waiting for you.

321
00:19:39,420 --> 00:19:40,300
Let's duel.

322
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:49,450
Yo!
